    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D sandbox space game, players take control of a customizable ship in the known Milky Way galaxy. The game combines strategic space simulation with point and click controls, where players can engage in exploration, mining, trading, bounty hunting, and piracy. Ships are equipped with various modules for different tasks, and players can have an army of those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/15b5743452a4eeb529707fa840f6498f.poster.avif?t=1748501229\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/15b5743452a4eeb529707fa840f6498f.webm?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/15b5743452a4eeb529707fa840f6498f.mp4?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world is populated by NPC Orders with their own goals, and player actions affect Order reputations and standings. Players can explore a galaxy mostly empty of life, except for pockets of civilizations and stations that offer various facilities. A simulated market with supply and demand mechanics influences the prices of goods across different trading posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/37ae8b81ca0ba5495b3e44d9b28b6ea8.poster.avif?t=1748501229\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/37ae8b81ca0ba5495b3e44d9b28b6ea8.webm?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/37ae8b81ca0ba5495b3e44d9b28b6ea8.mp4?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A familiar experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features pixel art visuals and an immersive, dynamic soundtrack. The gameplay is designed to be seamless. While primarily a single-player experience, the game allows for optional multiplayer features, like persistent game world. Set in a rich universe of exploration and choice, this game offers endless opportunities for players to shape their own story, whether by hoarding credits to become the richest person in the galaxy, becoming a hired gun, a feared pirate, or pursuing a career in mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you be?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D sandbox space game, players take control of a customizable ship in the known Milky Way galaxy. The game combines strategic space simulation with point and click controls, where players can engage in exploration, mining, trading, bounty hunting, and piracy. Ships are equipped with various modules for different tasks, and players can have an army of those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/15b5743452a4eeb529707fa840f6498f.poster.avif?t=1748501229\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/15b5743452a4eeb529707fa840f6498f.webm?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/15b5743452a4eeb529707fa840f6498f.mp4?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world is populated by NPC Orders with their own goals, and player actions affect Order reputations and standings. Players can explore a galaxy mostly empty of life, except for pockets of civilizations and stations that offer various facilities. A simulated market with supply and demand mechanics influences the prices of goods across different trading posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/37ae8b81ca0ba5495b3e44d9b28b6ea8.poster.avif?t=1748501229\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/37ae8b81ca0ba5495b3e44d9b28b6ea8.webm?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570780/extras/37ae8b81ca0ba5495b3e44d9b28b6ea8.mp4?t=1748501229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A familiar experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features pixel art visuals and an immersive, dynamic soundtrack. The gameplay is designed to be seamless. While primarily a single-player experience, the game allows for optional multiplayer features, like persistent game world. Set in a rich universe of exploration and choice, this game offers endless opportunities for players to shape their own story, whether by hoarding credits to become the richest person in the galaxy, becoming a hired gun, a feared pirate, or pursuing a career in mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you be?</p>",
    "short_description": "Customize your ship to fit your needs in the deep space. Explore the Milky Way in this ultimate open world sandbox.",
